Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.99,0:00:05.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這可不是在開玩笑啊  吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.53,0:00:07.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這醜態到底是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:12.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過  還真是被漂亮地將了一軍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.03,0:00:16.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZAFT那個武器到底是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.42,0:00:20.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,得意洋洋發表了宣戰公告再出兵
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.92,0:00:23.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卻挨了當頭一棒又灰溜溜撤退嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.49,0:00:27.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你寫的劇本是喜劇嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:32.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這下大西洋聯邦那些傢伙也不知所措了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.84,0:00:36.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,派去攻擊地球上ZAFT軍據點的部隊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:35.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在也是待機中吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:42.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,意氣風發揮出去的拳頭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.86,0:00:44.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,若就這樣放下拳頭調頭就跑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.12,0:00:47.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可就成世人的笑柄了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.63,0:00:50.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼該怎麼辦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.27,0:00:54.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們該找誰出氣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.27,0:00:57.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉普利爾  找你嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:00:59.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別胡說八道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.18,0:01:05.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這場戰爭更是非贏不可了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.24,0:01:09.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個將我們的核武瞬間抹殺的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.27,0:01:12.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拿著那種東西的怪物待在天上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:15.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,叫人怎麼安得下心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.66,0:01:17.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰爭將會繼續
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.58,0:01:20.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,返回以前的計劃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.94,0:01:23.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 還要更強化
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.77,0:01:27.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次定要將他們徹底打垮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.97,0:01:30.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,直到完全剝奪其力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.75,0:01:58.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  經PLANT最高評議會全議員表決
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.79,0:02:01.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,同意國防委員會的提案
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.71,0:02:10.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  這純屬積極行使自衛權
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:12.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請切記
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.89,0:02:16.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無法控制感情  過度擴大戰火
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.31,0:02:19.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就會重蹈上次大戰覆轍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.13,0:02:26.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,手中再次拿起的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.92,0:02:31.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次必須成為終結一切戰鬥之物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.70,0:02:33.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對此我寄予殷切期望
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,優しいその指が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,終わりに触れる時
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今だけ　君だけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,信じても言いいだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰もね崩れてく
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,願いの求め過ぎて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自分が落ちて行く
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,場所を捜してる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,傷つけて 揺れるしか出来ない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ざわめく想いが
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らの真実なら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,壊れる地から動けない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,淋しい羽根重ねて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出逢う光の無い 時代の眩しさだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,変われる地から恐れない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,深い鼓動の先に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,交わす炎よ描かれた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,運命に届け
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:04.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn华文中宋\fs35\b1\pos(850,662)}{\fad(150,70)\3c&H000000&}奧布行政府
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.35,0:04:04.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不行不行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:06.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.94,0:04:08.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無論如何
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.27,0:04:10.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在絕不能締結這種同盟條約
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.15,0:04:12.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是首相
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.90,0:04:14.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大西洋聯邦做了些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.24,0:04:17.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們不是也親眼看到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:19.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,單方面的宣戰公告
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.08,0:04:21.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有核攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.87,0:04:23.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那種國家有什麼安全保障
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.29,0:04:28.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說到底現在威脅世界安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.33,0:04:30.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不就是這個大西洋聯邦嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.84,0:04:33.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那為什麼還非得和他們聯手不可
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.67,0:04:34.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.55,0:04:35.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是首相
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.18,0:04:39.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請拋棄那種不成熟的思想
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.39,0:04:43.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,若您要問理由  我來回答吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.48,0:04:47.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正因為是那種國家  首相
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.02,0:04:50.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.52,0:04:53.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大西洋聯邦的做法確實很蠻橫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.98,0:04:55.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,做出那種事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.11,0:04:56.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,恕我直言
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.20,0:05:02.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今不用首相說  我們都十分清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.79,0:05:06.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但又如何
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:11.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,首相打算讓奧布今後如何自處
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.46,0:05:17.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拒絕這次同盟  不和地球各國聯手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:20.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,與遠在天上的PLANT為友
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.14,0:05:24.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在這星球上再次一國孤立嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.06,0:05:25.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.64,0:05:29.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本國和平安全的話  那就行了?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.48,0:05:32.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,蒙受災難的其他各國
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.02,0:05:35.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,您都不打算施與援手嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.44,0:05:36.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.20,0:05:39.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那您打算怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.28,0:05:44.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布…奧布要一如既往
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.04,0:05:46.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,走中立獨立的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.08,0:05:49.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,然後再次將國家焚燒殆盡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.42,0:05:50.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,像烏茲米大人那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.18,0:06:09.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒那麼說！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.06,0:06:13.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這種形勢下稍有不慎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.36,0:06:16.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難保不會重蹈覆轍
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.53,0:06:20.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,首相
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.03,0:06:23.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嚮往和平與國家安全的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.12,0:06:26.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們大家都與您無異
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.70,0:06:31.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正因如此  才提出締結這個同盟的提議
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.21,0:06:32.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,烏納特
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.67,0:06:38.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大西洋聯邦現在沒提出把奧布怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.26,0:06:42.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  這樣發展下去將會如何
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.01,0:06:47.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,結為同盟便可了結的話或許會更好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.68,0:06:49.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為何您想不到這點
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.23,0:06:53.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,意氣行事  四處樹敵
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.31,0:06:57.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,與那個大國為敵會是何等危險
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.23,0:07:00.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,您不可能不知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.99,0:07:01.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.91,0:07:10.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們不能再犯錯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.29,0:07:13.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再讓這個國家遭受戰火煎熬
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.88,0:07:18.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,比起傳統、正義和輿論
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:22.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在請您優先考慮國家與人民的安全
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.26,0:07:23.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,首相
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.73,0:07:34.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.11,0:07:41.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧  你似乎很累
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:46.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.53,0:07:51.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  當時對你直言進諫是我的責任
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.29,0:07:54.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  這我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:07:57.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我還太不成熟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.59,0:08:03.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這下又要被首長們嘲笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:06.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的  大家也都理解
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.14,0:08:10.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是這次的事件太重大而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.06,0:08:12.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對你來說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.64,0:08:17.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,馬修諾也不是想說烏茲米大人的不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.90,0:08:23.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是在擔心身為女兒的你重蹈覆轍而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:24.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.78,0:08:28.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  總之先休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.57,0:08:29.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想喝點什麼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.91,0:08:31.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是稍微吃點什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.41,0:08:33.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不用  我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.37,0:08:35.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.83,0:08:39.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真可憐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.09,0:08:43.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你還只是個18歲的女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:49.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但沒事的  有我在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.36,0:09:02.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這...但是艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.23,0:09:03.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經開戰了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:06.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都被發宣戰佈告了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:08.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.99,0:09:10.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但沒辦法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:13.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的物資補給還沒結束
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.37,0:09:17.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,呃  但現在不是說這些的時候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.37,0:09:19.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你很焦急
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.96,0:09:22.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,話雖如此  現在我們匆忙出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:24.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又能幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.88,0:09:30.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,相反也有最微妙的時期  阿瑟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.80,0:09:34.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,氣勢洶洶的第一波核攻擊被擋下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.31,0:09:37.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球軍也茫然不知所措吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.77,0:09:39.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,前往攻擊卡潘塔利亞的部隊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.81,0:09:41.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也包圍在那裡沒有動作不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.94,0:09:43.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這...正因如此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.23,0:09:46.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果現在本艦隨意行事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:48.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難保不會增加不必要的刺激
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.24,0:09:50.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你想當導火線嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:52.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不  怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.87,0:09:58.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,情勢不穩定的話就更需要將艦船準備萬全
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:02.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好奧布還不是地球軍陣營
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.63,0:10:07.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要出航先靜觀其變也不遲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.76,0:10:11.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,軍總部也沒下達任何命令
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.18,0:10:14.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.39,0:10:16.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.85,0:10:18.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不知要等到何時
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.44,0:10:29.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn华文中宋\fs35\b1\pos(950,666)\3c&H000000&}{\fad(150,60)}ZAFT軍事據點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:28.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確認第4戰鬥群展開完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.61,0:10:32.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還真是老套的說辭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.74,0:10:34.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn华文中宋\fs35\b1\pos(912,666)}{\fad(150,70)}ZAFT軍司令部
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.78,0:10:35.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,積極行使自衛權
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.16,0:10:40.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就這麼回事  政治場面話沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.04,0:10:48.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為在第一波中被包圍的直布羅陀 和卡潘塔利亞駐軍解圍當然不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.71,0:10:49.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過之後…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:53.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這下會怎麼樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.22,0:10:59.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然我們也不想挑起上次大戰那樣的戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.89,0:11:04.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是為了找到安撫國民感情的合適材料
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.73,0:11:06.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓戰爭結束
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.82,0:11:10.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,之後就是政治上的交涉了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.74,0:11:15.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但對再次打來核武的自然人的仇恨
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.70,0:11:17.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已無法消失了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.99,0:11:19.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.87,0:11:25.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今後就得看議長的手腕了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.51,0:11:32.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是這樣啊  作為PLANT
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.47,0:12:21.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,伊扎克
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.02,0:12:22.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你這小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.18,0:12:25.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這到底怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.14,0:12:27.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,慢 慢著  喂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.65,0:12:30.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什麼  這麼突然
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.69,0:12:32.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我還想問你呢  阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.40,0:12:35.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們現在可是忙得不可開交
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.11,0:12:38.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被評議會招來還以為是什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.28,0:12:41.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,居然是做你的護衛監視？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.54,0:12:44.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼我非得為這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.04,0:12:47.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被從前線叫回來不可
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.58,0:12:48.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,護衛監視？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.08,0:12:51.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你申請外出了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.84,0:12:52.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,堤亞哥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.09,0:12:53.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.63,0:12:56.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過  你也知道現在的形勢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.01,0:12:58.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是友國的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.14,0:13:01.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也不能在PLANT內隨便遛達吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.39,0:13:05.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  這我聽說了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.81,0:13:07.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會有同行者隨同
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.40,0:13:10.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但竟然是…你？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.48,0:13:12.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.24,0:13:20.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是某個明白人安排的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.50,0:13:27.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  你想去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.62,0:13:30.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要是去購物什麼的我可饒不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.75,0:13:32.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不會的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.05,0:13:35.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是想去尼高爾他們的墓看看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.59,0:13:40.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為太少回PLANT來了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:44.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以想去一趟而已
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.46,0:14:15.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,積極行使自衛權
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:18.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然ZAFT也有所行動嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.97,0:14:20.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.59,0:14:21.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,連核武都打來了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.89,0:14:23.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能無動於衷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.89,0:14:27.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第一波攻擊的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.68,0:14:29.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也出去迎擊了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.27,0:14:34.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們毫無疑問是打算用那個毀滅PLANT
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.61,0:14:38.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.32,0:14:42.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你在這裡幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:47.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布會有什麼行動
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.91,0:14:50.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.21,0:14:56.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,回來吧  阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.76,0:15:00.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然會有很多麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.55,0:15:01.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我來想辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.72,0:15:06.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以  你回PLANT吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.64,0:15:10.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不  但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.39,0:15:13.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我和他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.81,0:15:15.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原本早就該死了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.66,0:15:27.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是狄蘭達爾議長這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.83,0:15:29.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因大人們的原因而開始的戰爭中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.16,0:15:31.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓年輕人上戰場送死
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.46,0:15:34.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,把在那裡犯下的錯誤作為罪責
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:36.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在還要處分他們的話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.21,0:15:40.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底誰來承擔PLANT的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:43.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我想讓經歷過痛苦的他們
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.93,0:15:47.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,成為構築和平未來的棟樑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.35,0:15:52.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以  我現在還穿著軍服
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.81,0:15:55.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然只能這樣做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:58.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但也算能做些什麼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.82,0:16:01.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了PLANT和死去的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:03.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,伊扎克…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.78,0:16:06.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你也得做點什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.70,0:16:11.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有那樣的能力  想這樣白費嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.83,0:16:18.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全艦  軌道降落最終階段發動
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:33.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經刻不容緩了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.10,0:16:36.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.77,0:16:38.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別看卡嘉莉那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.31,0:16:41.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是那麼愚蠢的女孩  父親
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.86,0:16:43.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然還是個孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.49,0:16:47.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的  我會好好說服她
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.70,0:16:49.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,包括結婚的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.95,0:16:56.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多也該讓她認清自己現在的立場了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.21,0:16:58.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,時限到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.01,0:17:06.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.22,0:17:07.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.59,0:17:08.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聽這個
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.43,0:17:10.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva能聽到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.39,0:17:14.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒時間了  ZAFT很快就會開始…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.10,0:17:16.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是隱秘頻道  剛才起就一直…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.64,0:17:18.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs35}…卡潘塔利亞的降落登陸作戰吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.15,0:17:21.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣的話奧布也不會坐視不管
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.44,0:17:25.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被黑子圍住的白子也會被掀翻變成黑色
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.99,0:17:26.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在變成那種情況前趕快出航吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.20,0:17:29.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聽到了嗎  Minerva
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.70,0:17:32.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是Minerva艦長  塔利雅 庫拉提斯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.87,0:17:35.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你是哪位  這通信是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.83,0:17:37.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  這可真是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.33,0:17:40.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真高興聽到您的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.67,0:17:42.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幸會
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.71,0:17:44.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事情就如我所說
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.92,0:17:47.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再悠哉下去可就麻煩囉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.09,0:17:51.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,匿名的情報正規軍沒可能相信吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.10,0:17:54.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你是誰  有什麼目的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.60,0:17:59.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,您知道安特留 巴爾特菲路特這個人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.85,0:18:01.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是他的傳話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.32,0:18:06.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沙漠之虎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.57,0:18:09.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之警告過了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.61,0:18:11.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,降落作戰開始的話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.41,0:18:14.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,與大西洋聯邦的結盟也在所難免吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:17.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就算阿斯哈首相再努力也沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.46,0:18:20.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,選擇留下來也沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.42,0:18:23.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來就看你的判斷了  艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.26,0:18:28.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,祝您好運
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.97,0:18:34.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.39,0:18:36.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,積極行使自衛權
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:39.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然話是這麼說 但戰爭是多變的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.27,0:18:43.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,濺出的火花會擴散到何種地步
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.27,0:18:44.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.32,0:18:49.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要和大西洋聯邦締結同盟條約
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.24,0:18:54.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了不再重演悲劇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.09,0:19:06.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.59,0:19:09.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也許地球軍提高了警戒等級
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.34,0:19:11.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通信干擾嚴重
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.09,0:19:14.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷射也無法聯絡到卡潘塔利亞
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.35,0:19:17.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.47,0:19:19.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然仍未接到命令
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.39,0:19:21.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva明晨出航
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:22.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.02,0:19:24.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通告全艦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.56,0:19:26.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出航後十天之內必會遭遇戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.98,0:19:28.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要保持警惕
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.78,0:19:29.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.78,0:19:34.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,按預定時間出航
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.57,0:19:37.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各艦員盡快完成最終檢查
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.66,0:19:39.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,炮術B班到第三裝甲區
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.75,0:19:42.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下令黃色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.66,0:19:45.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,駕駛員到待機室集合
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.75,0:19:48.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是ZAFT的降落作戰是幾時
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.34,0:19:49.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.59,0:19:53.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過  這下和奧布也成敵對了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.84,0:19:55.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我還挺喜歡這個國家的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.97,0:19:59.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  對真來說有痛苦的回憶…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.81,0:20:00.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.27,0:20:05.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.11,0:20:09.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那時攻擊奧布的地球軍
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.48,0:20:10.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次變同盟了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.74,0:20:14.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們到底要任性妄為到什麼地步
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.95,0:20:16.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不  這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:17.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要是變成敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.28,0:20:19.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次就讓我來毀滅吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.49,0:20:21.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種國家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.08,0:20:23.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.30,0:20:33.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,FCS連接
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.88,0:20:35.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能量總線啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.68,0:20:36.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,閘門開啟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.39,0:20:43.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,微速前進
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.23,0:20:45.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva  出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.31,0:20:47.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,微速前進
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.69,0:20:49.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva  出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.91,0:21:01.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.83,0:21:04.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不  雖然很遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.87,0:21:06.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這也是沒辦法的事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.96,0:21:10.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,首相親自送行的盛情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.21,0:21:12.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會忘記
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.72,0:21:26.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法  卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.31,0:21:28.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,政治不是理想
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.48,0:21:30.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而是現實
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.57,0:21:34.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你已經很努力了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.40,0:21:37.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,突然被請上首相寶座
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.70,0:21:40.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,人民都很喜歡你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.83,0:21:42.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.37,0:21:47.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以放心吧  有我在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.00,0:21:49.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,作為支持你的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.63,0:21:51.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,丈夫
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.46,0:21:55.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快舉行婚禮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.30,0:21:58.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了你  也為了人民
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.13,0:22:00.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是最適合的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.35,0:22:03.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉  這…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.51,0:22:05.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如此一來將會獲得新生
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.93,0:22:07.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不論是你還是奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.48,0:22:12.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是  請接狄蘭達爾議長
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:00.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,言葉を重ねても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:00.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,分かり合えないこと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:00.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,まだ知らなかったね
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:00.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,君だけを抱きしめたくて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:00.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,失くした夢　君は
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:00.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,「諦メナイデ」と云った
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:00.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,遠く離れてるほどに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:00.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,近くに感じてる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:00.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,寂しさも 強さへと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:00.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,變わってく 君を思ったら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:00.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,切なく胸を刺す
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:00.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それは夢の欠片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:00.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ありのまま  出逢えてた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:00.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,その奇跡  もう一度信じて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.12,0:23:24.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被背叛了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.87,0:23:27.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種想法是因為信任嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.67,0:23:28.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.46,0:23:31.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事態不隨所願
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.71,0:23:33.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,失望化為怒意
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.46,0:23:34.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,包圍其身
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.55,0:23:38.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各自選擇的道路前方會是…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.39,0:23:43.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下回 機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.06,0:23:45.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,血染的大海
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.19,0:23:48.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,毀滅青色的力量吧 Zamzazar
